// BSGeometry (pieces with live D3D11 vertex/index buffers) and draws it each
// frame through a self-contained D3D11 pipeline (own shaders and states, no
// engine render-state hijacking) into an offscreen a client page shows as a
// texture image. The item view (ItemRenderer.h) lives in this TU too
// because it reuses the file-static collectors and GPU bundle.

