        //      strength) riding the broad base lobe. One broad Blinn-Phong
        //      lobe reads as dull plastic — the tight lobe is the "alive"
        //      skin glint.
        //   2. Fill-light spec (broad lobe, 0.6×): the engine specs every
        //      light; key-only left the fill side of the face dead flat.
        //   3. Grazing Fresnel sheen (0.03): subtle edge life at glancing
