            // armor doesn't look matte head-on — 0.15 floor blended with
            // the (1 - ndotv)^5 Fresnel curve.
            // The item view takes a metal's curve instead: it reflects metalLook.y of the light head-on, nearly all
            // of it at grazing angles, so a plate reads as metal from the front too.
            float metalCoverage = metalLook.x > 0.5 ? lerp(metalLook.y, 1.0, fresnel) : lerp(0.15, 1.0, fresnel);
